ent-LavalandBossAshDrake = ash drake
    .desc = Guardian of the Necropolis.
ent-LavalandBossColossus = Colossus
    .desc = A monstrous creature protected by heavy shielding.
ent-LavalandBossMegaLegion = Mega Legion
    .desc = One of many, and soon many more.
ent-MobBloodDrunkMiner = blood-drunk miner
    .desc = A miner destined to wander forever, engaged in an endless hunt.
blood-drunk-miner-butcher = The blood-drunk miner tears apart { $target } and drinks in the carnage!

# Advanced roster
ent-MobChildishOni = childish oni
    .desc = An oni from the demonic capital, eager to turn battle into a cruel game.
ent-MobSpiderMercury = Spider of Mercury
    .desc = A pulsing, impossible exoskeleton that seems to observe every weapon raised against it.
ent-MobSpiderMercuryUfo = Spider of Mercury
    .desc = The exoskeleton was only a relay. Its true body descends from above.
ent-MobSpiderMercuryUltimate = the ultimate one
    .desc = Adaptation complete. Every pattern now converges on you.

# Classic trophies
ent-TrophyLavalandLegionSkull = legion skull
    .desc = Increases the crusher's firing and attack speed.
ent-TrophyLavalandBDMEye = eye of the blood-drunk miner
    .desc = Makes the crusher lighter and grants brief control immunity after consuming a marker.
ent-TrophyLavalandAshDrakeSpike = ash drake spike
    .desc = Consuming a marker damages and throws nearby enemies.
ent-TrophyLavalandBubblegumDemonClaws = demon claws
    .desc = Increases melee damage and life-steal.
ent-TrophyLavalandColossusBlasterTubes = colossus blaster tubes
    .desc = Improves projectile velocity and empowers the next shot after consuming a marker.

