# Childish Oni actions
ent-ActionChildishOniDemonicHandSpiral = demonic hand spiral
    .desc = Unwinds a rotating stream of demonic hands from the arena's center.
ent-ActionChildishOniRampage = rampage
    .desc = Leaps at the target, damaging the landing zone and surrounding it with fire.
ent-ActionChildishOniRingClose = close ring of fire
    .desc = Creates a tight ring of demonic fire.
ent-ActionChildishOniRingWide = wide ring of fire
    .desc = Creates a broad ring of demonic fire.
ent-ActionChildishOniClawSlash = claw slash
    .desc = Launches a brutal, very short-ranged claw strike.
ent-ActionChildishOniFlurry = flurry of slashes
    .desc = Fires flaming slashes in every direction.
ent-ActionChildishOniHandSide = far-side hand
    .desc = Sends a demonic hand through the target from a random side.
ent-ActionChildishOniHandBarrage = hand barrage
    .desc = Converges several demonic hands on the target.
ent-ActionChildishOniFlamingSlash = flaming slash
    .desc = Fires a fast, burning slash at the target.
ent-ActionChildishOniBladeFlamingSlash = flaming slash
    .desc = Releases one of the nameless sword's curses as a burning projectile.

childish-oni-rampage = Kahahaha!
childish-oni-ring = My blood is boiling... literally!
childish-oni-flurry = Hehe! Try to counter this!

oni-idle-1 = Oh? A pack of humans, is it? At least you look worth eating.
oni-idle-2 = If you value your lives, run now. If not…
oni-idle-3 = Kehehe… I was hoping today wouldn't be boring.
oni-idle-4 = Don't glare at me like that. You'll only disappoint yourself.
oni-idle-5 = Haa… sake always tastes better when prey wanders in on its own.
oni-idle-6 = To wander into an oni's lair… I guess those oblivious to death do exist.
oni-idle-7 = You do know there's nothing worse than a bored oni, right?
oni-change-1 = Very well. I will savor this sake with your meat!
oni-taunt-1 = Don't bore me now.
oni-taunt-2 = You're not running. Is it courage… or just nowhere left to go?
oni-taunt-3 = You think that gear is enough to stop me?
oni-taunt-4 = Kehehe… I can smell your fear. Not bad at all.
oni-taunt-5 = Hah. Humans always look bigger before they start screaming.
oni-taunt-6 = Time to devour…
oni-taunt-7 = Meat is meant to be eaten.
oni-taunt-8 = Try harder. I don't want to be bored.
oni-change-2 = Hmph… playtime's over. Show me something worth breaking.
oni-rage-1 = I see. You're still standing.
oni-rage-2 = Don't get carried away, human.
oni-rage-3 = Do not mock me! I am the leader of the oni!
oni-rage-4 = So… you actually mean to kill me?
oni-rage-5 = Tch… stop squirming!
oni-rage-6 = You're starting to annoy me!
oni-rage-7 = Enough! I'll crush you!
oni-change-3 = Very well! Prepare to witness the form of a true oni!
oni-true-1 = No reason to hold back now. Let's see how long you last.
oni-true-2 = That killing intent… I don't hate it!
oni-true-3 = Come on! More! Entertain me!
oni-true-4 = This is it! This is battle! Now I feel alive!
oni-true-5 = Don't you dare fall yet!
oni-true-6 = Yes… break, scream, struggle!
oni-true-7 = This is how a fight should be!
oni-true-8 = Good! Very good! Keep coming!
oni-true-9 = Hahahaha! Don't disappoint me now!

# Spider of Mercury actions
ent-ActionSpiderEtherDrain = ether drain
    .desc = Drains nearby life and converts it into repairs.
ent-ActionSpiderPlanktonFlood = plankton flood
    .desc = Floods the arena with dark-matter projectiles.
ent-ActionSpiderCosmicRays = cosmic rays
    .desc = Saturates both axes of the arena with energy.
ent-ActionSpiderResonanceHorizontal = horizontal resonance
    .desc = Tears a horizontal energy line across the arena.
ent-ActionSpiderResonanceVertical = vertical resonance
    .desc = Tears a vertical energy line across the arena.
ent-ActionSpiderEnergyDischarge = energy discharge
    .desc = Releases a dense radial projectile wave.
ent-ActionSpiderEnergySurge = energy surge
    .desc = Collapses energy around the selected position.
ent-ActionSpiderSupercell = Galactica supercell
    .desc = Fires a focused fan of cosmic projectiles.
ent-ActionSpiderSolarStorm = solar storm
    .desc = Creates three expanding rings of stellar energy.
ent-ActionSpiderParadigmInflation = paradigm inflation
    .desc = Overloads matter around the selected position.
ent-ActionSpiderPhaseConversion = phase conversion
    .desc = Converts the Spider's current combat paradigm.
ent-ActionSpiderReflectiveThreads = reflective threads
    .desc = Greatly reduces incoming damage for a short time.
ent-ActionSpiderDarkMatterShell = dark-matter shell
    .desc = Wraps the Spider in a dangerous energy shell.
ent-ActionSpiderConvergence = convergence
    .desc = Pulls nearby matter inward and drains it.

